cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it as below."
title: "Thermodynamics of nucleotide formation"
abstract: "Reproducible companion to a study of nucleotide-formation free energies across 21 canonical and noncanonical base families: 417 calculation records, the analysis code that turns them into the published tables and figures, and a guided notebook. Companion manuscript: 'Energetics of nucleotide formation suggest a preference for adenine and cytosine, but not the canonical genetic alphabet as a whole' (PNAS, submitted)."
authors:
